Package: mo62a-factory
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: MO-62A SDK <sdk@mo-62a>
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Depends: python3, python3-libgpiod, python3-qrcode, python3-pil
Description: MO-62A factory production-test tools (internal, not for customers)
 On-device commissioning and production-test commands for the MO-62A board:
 EEPROM identity programming, loopback/self-test helpers, etc.
 .
 Install before production test:  dpkg -i mo62a-factory_*.deb
 Remove afterwards:               apt remove mo62a-factory
 .
 Deliberately excluded from the customer image (rootfs-overlay) for security;
 shipped and installed only on the factory line.
